    - `🍎`              — head 🍎, no modifiers
    - `🍎.color_red`    — head 🍎 + modifier color_red ("red apple")
    - `🍪.two`          — head 🍪 + count modifier ("two cookies")
    - `📖.my`           — head 📖 + possession modifier ("my book")
    - `🤗.big.please`   — modifiers stack

